    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d395">

                <pb facs="0573" n="477" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg477"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Allen to Mr.
                            Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Seoul, Korea</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-11-13"><hi rendition="#italic">November 13,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 35.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to hand you inclosed a
                    copy of the regulations for the foreign settlements of Chinnampo and Mokpo, the
                    new Korean ports opened to settlement on October 1 last.</p>
                <p>The foreign representatives had a number of meetings to consider the draft of
                    these regulations, which was prepared by Mr. Brown, the chief commissioner of
                    customs. We most carefully considered every article and made some important
                    changes, which were accepted.</p>
                <p>From my long experience with the foreign settlement at Chemulpo, I feel sure that
                    these new regulations will be found to be very satisfactory.</p>
                <p>I trust the Department will approve of my action in signing the same. I might
                    explain that my reason for adding my consular title to this signature was that
                    it seemed proper to me because of the fact that a court is provided for in the
                    regulations.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Horace N. Allen</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d395-a1.xml" xpointer="d395-a1"/>
